---
import portrait from "@/assets/images/me/andre-marinho.webp";
import JsonLd from "@/components/seo/JsonLd.astro";
import PageTitle from "@/components/ui/PageTitle.astro";
import Image from "@/components/ui/ResponsiveImage.astro";
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
import { aboutMetadata } from "@/lib/metadata";
import { profileJsonLd } from "@/lib/seo";
---

<Base metadata={aboutMetadata}>
  <article class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 lg:px-8">
    <JsonLd data={profileJsonLd} />
    <PageTitle>About</PageTitle>

    <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-6 sm:gap-10">
      <p
        class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-display text-xl font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-pretty sm:text-3xl"
      >
        I’m André, a full-stack engineer with a background in business
        operations and data.
      </p>
      <Image
        src={portrait}
        alt="André Marinho smiling"
        width={128}
        height={128}
        sizes="(min-width: 640px) 128px, 80px"
        loading="eager"
        fetchpriority="high"
        class="size-20 shrink-0 rounded-xl border border-border sm:size-32"
      />
    </div>

    <section aria-labelledby="context" class="prose">
      <h2 id="context">A little context</h2>
      <p>
        I live in Salvador, Brazil, and have been building websites and web
        applications professionally since 2023. Before that, I worked in
        business operations, data, and consulting.
      </p>
      <p>
        I work with TypeScript, React, Next.js, Node.js, and PostgreSQL, from
        interfaces and APIs to data models, tests, and deployment. I draw on my
        consulting experience when working out what a client needs and deciding
        what to build.
      </p>
      <p>
        Alongside client work, I build and maintain open-source projects like{" "}
        <a href="/projects/turistar">Turistar</a>, a collaborative trip planner.
        This site is where I keep my{" "}
        <a href="/projects">projects</a>{" "}and{" "}
        <a href="/posts">write about what I’m learning</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="experience" class="mt-10 sm:mt-12">
      <h2 class="prose-h2" id="experience">What I’ve been working on</h2>
      <ol class="mt-4 flex flex-col">
        <li
          class="grid items-start gap-x-6 gap-y-1 py-3 sm:grid-cols-[6rem_minmax(0,1fr)]"
        >
          <h3 class="text-base font-medium leading-6 sm:col-start-2">
            Full Stack Engineer · Freelance
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-xs leading-5 text-muted sm:col-start-1 sm:row-start-1 sm:leading-6"
          >
            2025 – now
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:col-start-2">
            Building full-stack products for clients, from architecture to
            deployment, independently and with teams.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li
          class="grid items-start gap-x-6 gap-y-1 py-3 sm:grid-cols-[6rem_minmax(0,1fr)]"
        >
          <h3 class="text-base font-medium leading-6 sm:col-start-2">
            Full Stack Engineer · Duonorth Studio
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-xs leading-5 text-muted sm:col-start-1 sm:row-start-1 sm:leading-6"
          >
            2023 – 2025
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:col-start-2">
            Built websites, ecommerce stores, and custom integrations, working
            directly with clients from brief to launch.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li
          class="grid items-start gap-x-6 gap-y-1 py-3 sm:grid-cols-[6rem_minmax(0,1fr)]"
        >
          <h3 class="text-base font-medium leading-6 sm:col-start-2">
            Digital Solutions Consultant · Duonorth Studio
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-xs leading-5 text-muted sm:col-start-1 sm:row-start-1 sm:leading-6"
          >
            2017 – 2022
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:col-start-2">
            Founded a BI consultancy, building dashboards and automations before
            expanding into digital strategy and marketing.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li
          class="grid items-start gap-x-6 gap-y-1 py-3 sm:grid-cols-[6rem_minmax(0,1fr)]"
        >
          <h3 class="text-base font-medium leading-6 sm:col-start-2">
            Logistics Supervisor · Grupo Hemocat
          </h3>
          <p
            class="text-xs leading-5 text-muted sm:col-start-1 sm:row-start-1 sm:leading-6"
          >
            2015 – 2017
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted sm:col-start-2">
            Led 16 people across three logistics bases and built Power BI
            dashboards for stock and purchasing decisions.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <a
        href="/resume.pdf"
        download="Andre-Marinho-Resume.pdf"
        class="text-link mt-6 inline-flex min-h-11 flex-wrap items-center gap-2"
      >
        Download résumé
        <span class="mt-1 text-xs leading-6 text-muted">(PDF, English)</span>
      </a>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="history" class="prose">
      <h2 id="history">How I got here</h2>
      <p>
        At Hemocat, my manager spent about two hours a day copying numbers from
        the company’s system into a financial planning spreadsheet. I asked if I
        could try automating it. That became my first technical project:
        learning how the database worked and connecting it directly to Excel so
        she no longer had to copy the numbers by hand.
      </p>
      <p>
        In logistics, I worked on stock availability and the data behind the
        dashboards. Later, consulting brought me into websites and integrations
        with clients’ existing tools. By 2023, I had focused Duonorth on
        websites and software, implementing the solutions myself. In July 2025,
        software product development became my main occupation.
      </p>
      <p>
        I still spend time understanding how people work before deciding how the
        software should work. I wrote more about that path in{" "}
        <a href="/posts/before-i-called-it-code"
          >I Was Building Software Before I Called It Code</a
        >.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="off-screen" class="prose">
      <h2 id="off-screen">Away from the screen</h2>
      <p>
        I go to the beach regularly, read a lot, run, lift weights, and play
        classical guitar. I’m also learning to juggle, though I’m still a
        beginner.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
